      "name": "CameraModule.hpp",
      "filePath": "include/Modules/CameraModule.hpp",
      "summary": "相机模块头文件，定义CameraModule类（继承QObject和IModule），声明BuildError枚举、相机生命周期管理及帧采集的Qt信号槽接口，支持海康威视/度申多相机场景。",
      "tags": ["camera", "hardware-interface", "signal-slot", "image-acquisition", "module"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "通过Qt信号槽（frameCaptured1信号）实现跨线程帧数据传递；BuildError使用std::vector支持按相机索引报告多个构建错误。"
    },
    {
