      "summary": "缺陷剔除模块头文件，定义EliminateModule类（继承QObject和IModule），持有产品判定优先级队列和异步缺陷处理线程，负责根据检测结果决定产品是否剔除。",
      "tags": ["defect-elimination", "priority-queue", "quality-control", "module"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:include/Modules/IModule.hpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "IModule.hpp",
      "filePath": "include/Modules/IModule.hpp",
      "summary": "模块接口模板基类，定义所有功能模块的统一生命周期接口build/destroy/start/stop，通过模板参数TBuildError支持不同的构建错误返回类型（bool、void或vector）。",
      "tags": ["interface", "template", "lifecycle", "module-pattern", "abstract"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用C++模板实现编译时多态；TBuildError默认为bool，各模块按需实例化为void（ImgSaveModule）或std::vector<BuildError>（CameraModule）等变体。"
    },
