      "tags": ["image-saving", "async-io", "module", "persistence"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "build()返回void（TBuildError=void）表示构建阶段无错误返回；静态常量cimgSaveThreadNum(4)和cimgSaveQuality(80)硬编码线程数与JPEG质量。"
